* Steller Keyboard
A 5 column ergonomic keyboard with 3 thumbkeys.
Inspired by Steller's Jay.

** Design Decisions
   - 5x3 column-staggered finger matrix
   - pinky
   -- chocofi-style pinky stagger
   -- mild pinky splay
   -- top pinky on a separate column
   - thumbs
   -- 3 thumb keys
   -- Thumb keys extend inward. The home thumb key will be the innermost key. The goal is to avoid
      inward thumb curl.
   - choc v1 switches and keycaps
    - ambient twilights
   -- lamé keycaps
    -- jclpcb can print them in a dye-able material
   - Miryoku layout
   - Angle the pcb and trrs to match the desired keyboard rotation.

